        "jsCode": "// Reads the system prompt file (input from Read Prompt) and takes the combined message from Combine\nconst SP = (await this.helpers.getBinaryDataBuffer(0, 'data')).toString('utf8');\nif (SP.length < 500) throw new Error('System prompt file missing or empty');\nconst c = $('Combine').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { SP, kind: c.kind, fileId: c.fileId, hasMedia: !!c.fileId } }];"
